    "teach_3": {
      "id": "teach_3",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Leak questions can reveal tank capacity too.\n\nA leak empties a full tank in 8 h. An inlet adds 6 L/min. With both open, a full tank empties in 12 h.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_3_step"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_3_step": {
      "id": "teach_3_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The inlet offsets part of the leak:\n1/8 − 1/12 = 1/24 tank/hour.\nBut 6 L/min = 360 L/hour, so 1/24 tank = 360 L.\nCapacity = 24 × 360 = 8640 L.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_3"
        }
      ]
    },
