    "teach_4": {
      "id": "teach_4",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "A leak may begin only after part of the tank is filled.\n\nSuppose two inlets normally fill at 1/10 tank/hour. The tank reaches half full in 5 h. Then a leak removes one-fourth of the incoming flow.",
