        "text": "After the leak begins, only 3/4 of the incoming rate remains:\nnet = 3/4 × 1/10 = 3/40.\nThe last half takes (1/2) ÷ (3/40) = 20/3 h.\nTotal = 11 2/3 h.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
