      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "A delay itself can tell you how strong the leak is.\n\nTwo inlets together normally fill in 6 h. Because of leakage, they take 8 h.\nLeak = 1/6 − 1/8 = 1/24 tank/hour.",
