        "text": "You can now turn a delay into a leak rate.\n\nExpected fill rate − actual net fill rate = leak rate.\n\nThe same subtraction can reveal a waste pipe, a tank capacity, or the amount lost after a leak begins.\n\nNext, we compare pipes whose rates are linked by efficiency or diameter.",
